OL,3,W"###"###"###T///-./-,,-,.,/,/,-,.,,.///
OL,4,CUK to pay 'participation' fee to       
OL,5,Cdeliver EU deals                       
OL,6,GThe UK will pay a "participation fee"  
OL,7,Gto the EU as part of the deals agreed  
OL,8,Gby Andy Burnham, according to legal    
OL,9,Gdocuments.                             
OL,11,FThe surcharge will go towards the      
OL,12,Frunning costs of EU agencies and       
OL,13,Fsystems required to deliver two of the 
OL,14,Fagreements unveiled by the prime       
OL,15,Fminister last week.                    
OL,17,FIt will be paid in addition to a       
OL,18,Fcontribution towards costs that        
OL,19,Fbroadly mirrors how EU members         
OL,20,Fcontribute to the bloc's shared        
OL,21,Fbudget, the documents show.            
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
