OL,3,W"###"###"###T///-./-,,-,.,/,/,-,.,,.///
OL,4,CReform UK pledges to scrap hospital    
OL,5,Cparking fees in England                
OL,6,GReform UK is promising to scrap        
OL,7,Gparking fees at NHS hospitals in       
OL,8,GEngland for all patients, visitors,    
OL,9,Gand staff if it wins power at the next 
OL,10,Gelection.                              
OL,12,FThe party said rising parking charges  
OL,13,Fin recent years were unfair, with some 
OL,14,Fhospitals charging up to #20 a day for 
OL,15,Fparking spots.                         
OL,17,FIt says it would compensate hospital   
OL,18,Ftrusts for the #300m they currently    
OL,19,Fget from fees each year by raising     
OL,20,Fmore from foreign visitors using the   
OL,21,FNHS.                                   
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
