OL,3,W"###"###"###T///-./-,,-,.,/,/,-,.,,.///
OL,4,CMandelson kept shares as ambassador    
OL,5,Cdespite conflict of interest fears,    
OL,6,Cdocuments show                         
OL,7,GLord Mandelson still held shares in    
OL,8,Ghis lobbying company eight months      
OL,9,Gafter becoming US ambassador, despite  
OL,10,Ggovernment concens about conflicts of  
OL,11,Ginterest, newly released documents     
OL,12,Gshow.                                  
OL,14,FThe peer was sacked as ambassador last 
OL,15,Fyear by Sir Keir Starmer following     
OL,16,Frevelations about the extent of his    
OL,17,Frelationship with the late convicted   
OL,18,Fsex offender Jeffrey Epstein.          
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
